N_CITIES            34
POP_SIZE            1500
N_GENERATIONS       1000
GENERATE_COORDS     False
COORDS_TYPE         Italy
N_MIGR              10

ENDINPUT

Type of coordinates:
- Circular: city coordinates uniformly distributed on a circumference
- Square: city coordinates uniformly distributed inside a Square

When GENERATE_COORDS is True, coordinates are generated according to a circumference or the inside of a square
When GENERATE_COORDS is False, coordinates are read from a file chosen according to COORDS_TYPE. N_CITIES becomes irrelevant.